<tab><cl=F0F010>TOURNAMENTS<cl=A2A2A2><br><br>
<tab>
During the group <l="hts:\\language\tournament.hts">tournament, the<\l> names of the participants
have the color of the team they play for.<br>
Please note, if you damage someone from your group, or heal enemies, then damage points or cured health of allies are taken away from you, respectively.
